{"last_link_id": 66, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# I recommend Full-HD resolutions (1536x1536/1920x1088) for the best quality, but if you want to save on VRAM and generation time, you can use standard HD resolutions (960x960/1280x720), though that will likely reduce in a big quality loss."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [450, 200], "pos": [3650, 500], "id": 24, "properties": {}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# I tested various settings and find that this is the most optimal configuration for the best possible quality. You can reduce the steps all the way down to 4 if you really want to save on generation time, but this will likely have a noticeable effect on quality."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [550, 150], "pos": [4150, 300], "id": 27, "properties": {}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# The \"res_2s\" and \"bong_tangent\" sampler and scheduler respectively come from the \"Res4Lyf\" custom node. I find that this combo provides the best quality by far, but if you want you can also skip that node and just use one of ComfyUI's default samplers and schedulers. Do note that \"res_2s\" approximately doubles the generation time."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [550, 200], "pos": [4150, 500], "id": 17, "properties": {}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# I recommend using both the lightx2v and FusionX LoRa's as they distill the model steps and CFG down to 4/8 and 1 respectively, thereby massively speeding up generation time. I recommend using both in tandem at reduced strengths for each, as they complement each other very well and this way you avert the drawbacks each of them has, which is a very artificial and fake looking AI look. I find that 0.4 for both works best.\n\n# You can download the lightx2v LoRa [here](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan21_T2V_14B_lightx2v_cfg_step_distill_lora_rank32.safetensors) and the FusionX LoRa [here](https://huggingface.co/vrgamedevgirl84/Wan14BT2VFusioniX/resolve/main/FusionX_LoRa/Wan2.1_T2V_14B_FusionX_LoRA.safetensors).\n\n# You can also safely load any other normal LoRa's alongside them."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [400, 400], "pos": [3200, 300], "id": 25, "properties": {}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [52], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 21, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [450, 150], "pos": [3650, 100], "id": 4, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.43", "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [37], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["Wan2_1-T2V-14B_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors", "fp8_e4m3fn"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [456.7768859863281, 164.13223266601562], "pos": [2713.609619140625, -121.08563232421875], "id": 7, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.43", "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [35], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "CLIP", "links": [36], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Wan21_T2V_14B_lightx2v_cfg_step_distill_lora_rank32.safetensors", 0.4000000000000001, 0.4000000000000001], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 39, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模